---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/surfaces/Section.astro";
import Card from "@/components/surfaces/Card.astro";
import SectionHeader from "@/components/surfaces/SectionHeader.astro";
import Badge from "@/components/feedback/Badge.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Now"
  description="What I've been up to lately."
>
  <Section id="now" title="NOW.HTML" subtitle="Latest Updates" meta="[UPDATES]">
    <Card>
      <SectionHeader size="sm" title="What is this page?" />
      <p>The answer to “what are you up to lately?”. Part of the <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank">Now Now Now project</a
        >.</p>
    </Card>
    <Card variant="inset">
      <SectionHeader size="sm" title="Latest update: September 18th, 2026" />
      <ul>
        <li>
          <Badge size="md">[dev]</Badge> I'm currently working on a media tracker app which
          is something I've wanted to build for years and it's finally
          happening!!
        </li>
        <li>
          <Badge size="md">[dev]</Badge> <a
            href="https://greatsealstudios.com"
            target="_blank">Great Seal Studios</a
          > website needs a complete redesign and code restructure for the next era
          we're about to enter so I'm beginning to gather inspiration and getting
          a moodboard together.
        </li>
        <li>
          <Badge size="md">[art]</Badge>  I've started <a href="/art">sketching</a> again! mostly
          with ink and watercolor but I want to try gouache again.
        </li>
        <li>
          <Badge size="md">[gaming]</Badge>  There has been a sort of Elden Ring renaissance
          with the Tarnished Edition release, so I've been playing it a lot
          again, and with friends too using the seamless co-op mod which has
          been so much fun.
        </li>
        <li>
          <Badge size="md">[watching]</Badge>  The wnba is back so I'm following my favorite
          team (go Aces!). Almost time for the playoffs.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Card>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style> 

  ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
</style>
